// The main task waits in task.receive() and the one spawned task waits too,
// so no task can run again: the program halts with DeadlockError
// (spec/04-semantics.md, Deadlock) and does not hang. The text of the report
// is implementation-defined.
fun waiter() {
    task.receive();
}

task.spawn(waiter);
task.receive();

// STATUS: error
